{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Text\/monospacedDigit()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Text"]]},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"nonisolated","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"monospacedDigit","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Text","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI4TextV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Text"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Return Value"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A text view with a modified font that uses fixed-width","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"numeric characters, while leaving other characters proportionally","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"spaced.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This modifier only affects numeric characters, and leaves all other","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"characters unchanged.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The following example shows the effect of ","type":"text"},{"code":"monospacedDigit()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"text view. It arranges two text views in a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/VStack"},{"text":", each displaying","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a formatted date that contains many instances of the c